Verse 1:
[Ab]I [Db/Ab]am [Ab/Eb]trusting [Db/Ab]Thee, Lord [Ab]Jesus,
[Ab]Trusting [Gdim]only [G7]Thee;
[Ab]Trusting [A]Thee [Am]for [Bbm/F]full salvation,
[Ab]Great and free.

Verse 2:
[Ab]I [Db/Ab]am [Ab/Eb]trusting [Db/Ab]Thee for [Ab]pardon;
[Ab]At [Db/Ab]Thy [Gdim]feet [Cm/G]I [G7]bow;
[Ab]For Thy [A]grace [Am]and [Bbm/F]tender [Db/Ab]mercy,
[Ab]Trusting now.

Verse 3:
[Ab]I [Db/Ab]am [Ab/Eb]trusting [Db/Ab]Thee to [Ab]guide me;
[Ab]Thou [Db/Ab]alone [Cm/G]shalt [G7]lead;
[Ab]Every [Am]day [Bbm/F]and hour [Db/Ab]supplying
[Ab]All my need.

Verse 4:
[Ab]I [Db/Ab]am [Ab/Eb]trusting [Db/Ab]Thee, Lord [Ab]Jesus;
[Ab]Never [Gdim]let [Cm/G]me [G7]fall;
[Ab]I am [A]trusting [Bbm/F]Thee forever,
[Ab]And for all.
